---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use"
  description="Terms governing use of the SOCHSE public informational website."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Terms of use"
    description="Terms for this public informational website. Client engagements use separate written agreements."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow-container prose">
      <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 31 July 2026</p>

      <h2>Informational website</h2>
      <p>
        This website describes SOCHSE, its services, planned capabilities, and
        selected founder work. It does not itself create a consulting
        relationship, service commitment, partnership, or warranty.
      </p>

      <h2>Private systems</h2>
      <p>
        OASIS, Vaartha, Vidscribe, Market Event Tracker, kbtrain, and other
        identified private systems are not public products. Their descriptions
        are high-level founder-provided overviews. No public access,
        demonstration, independent verification, release date, or offer for
        sale is provided.
      </p>

      <h2>No financial or medical advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website is investment, trading, legal, medical,
        rehabilitation, or fitness advice. Descriptions of market-research,
        monitoring, or movement-feedback systems do not claim validated
        outcomes and must not be relied upon for personal decisions.
      </p>

      <h2>Client work</h2>
      <p>
        Public references to client work are limited to approved, publicly
        viewable material. Private advertising, infrastructure, data, systems,
        and operations are outside those descriptions.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        External websites are controlled by their respective owners. A link
        does not guarantee continued availability, accuracy, security, or
        endorsement of every statement on the destination site.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Unless stated otherwise, website text, design, and original materials
        belong to SOCHSE or their respective rights holders. Private project
        descriptions do not grant any license to their code, data, strategies,
        models, or internal methods.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitations</h2>
      <p>
        This website is provided as available. To the extent permitted by law,
        SOCHSE is not liable for decisions made solely from general website
        information or for interruption of this informational site.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may change as the website and services develop. The
        effective date will be updated when material changes are published.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions: <a href="mailto:sochsecompass@gmail.com">sochsecompass@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
